## ── Sample 3D models ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Test models are large binaries — keep them out of history.
# Point tests at a local folder via an env var instead.
[Ss]amples/
[Tt]est[Mm]odels/
*.stl
*.3mf
*.step
*.stp
*.obj
*.ply
# ...except small hand-checked parser fixtures, which must be versioned.
!tests/**/[Ff]ixtures/
!tests/**/[Ff]ixtures/**

